menu "EchoGuard transmitter"

    config ECHOGUARD_TX_CHANNEL
        int "Wi-Fi channel (must match the receiver)"
        range 1 13
        default 11
        help
            Fixed 2.4 GHz channel used for the ESP-NOW broadcast. The receiver
            must be built with the same ECHOGUARD_RX_CHANNEL. Channel 11 is the
            official esp-csi example default. HT40 uses the secondary channel
            below the primary for channels 5..13 and above for channels 1..4.

    config ECHOGUARD_TX_RATE_HZ
        int "Packet send rate (packets per second)"
        range 10 200
        default 100
        help
            ESP-NOW broadcast rate. 100 Hz matches the official example and is
            enough to capture human motion. The effective rate is quantised to
            the FreeRTOS tick (CONFIG_FREERTOS_HZ=1000 -> 1 ms resolution).

endmenu
